{"title":"2602.14972 Use What You Know: Causal Foundation Models with Partial Graphs","markdown":{"headingText":"2602.14972 Use What You Know: Causal Foundation Models with Partial Graphs","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n- 作者/日期/来源：arXiv:2602.14972（2026-02-16，v2 2026-06-25）；Reuter、Dhir、Diaconu、Robertson、Ossen、Hutter、Weller、van der Wilk、Schölkopf；ICML 2026（PMLR 306）\n\n- **一句话定位**：给基于先验数据拟合网络（Prior-Data Fitted Networks, PFN）的因果基础模型（Causal Foundation Models, CFM）装上「领域知识接口」——用部分已知祖先矩阵（partially known ancestral matrix, PAM）在测试时注入完整、部分或零因果图信息。\n\n- **研究问题**：现有 CFM（Do-PFN、MACE-TNP 等）在上下文中仅用观测数据 D 对 SCM 后验 p(ψ|D) 积分，无法利用任何先验因果知识；当方向不可识别时会输出两个方向的混合后验（如两结点情形 0.5·P(Y|do(T),Y→T)+0.5·P(Y|do(T),T→Y)），估计过于保守。如何让单一模型按可用知识的多少灵活条件化。\n\n- **模型与方法**：SCM ψ=(G,{f_k},p(ε))，因果充分性、噪声独立、机制先验因子化（ICM 原理的实例化，Janzing & Schölkopf 2010）。条件化对象取 PAM T̃∈{−1,0,1}^{K×K}：T̃ij=1 已知 zi 是 zj 祖先、−1 已知非祖先、0 未知；祖先矩阵为邻接阵的传递闭包，比邻接阵更易获取且渐近信息等价。注入机制两种：(i) 结构注意力偏置——软偏置在注意力 logits 上加可学习标量（每层每头）β_anc/−β_non-anc，硬掩码置 −∞；(ii) 结构调制——GCN 在 T̃ 诱导的图上传播角色嵌入，经自适应层归一化（AdaLN）注入各 transformer 块。训练沿用 PFN 范式，最小化与条件干预分布（CID）p(y|do(t),x,D)=∫p(y|x,ψ_do(t))p(ψ|D)dψ 的前向 KL，并在「祖先信息量随机缺失」上摊销训练。\n\n- **主要命题/定理**：Proposition A.1（无混杂来自部分图知识）：因果充分 SCM 下，若 PAM 指定 t⇝y、所有 xi⇝t 与 xi⇝y，且排除 x 之外的 t,y 公共祖先，则 (y0,y1)⊥⊥t|x。经验结果：线性高斯先验上软注意力与 GCN+软注意力最优，祖先阵与邻接阵效果相当甚至略优（图3）；摊销模型性能接近专门化模型（图13）；复杂 TFM 先验（30,000 数据集）上完整图信息全面提升 NLL/MSE/R²，隐藏条目比例增大时性能平缓退化（图4）；标注「未知」远好于猜错方向（第5.4节）；RealCause 半合成基准（IHDP/ACIC/CPS/PSID）上编码无混杂的 PAM 系统性改善 √PEHE 与 ε_ATE（如 IHDP √PEHE 5.49±0.78 对无祖先信息 6.28±0.79），违反后门准则时大幅超过 CausalPFN 与 CausalFM。\n\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：承接 Schölkopf 组 CFM 主线（Robertson Do-PFN 2025、Dhir MACE-TNP 2025、Dhir 贝叶斯双变量因果发现 2024）；因子化机制先验显式回归 ICM 原理；把「机制独立→后验可区分方向」的贝叶斯因果发现论断转化为基础模型的实用条件化机制，是「因果推断遇上表格基础模型/上下文学习」议程的关键一环。\n\n- **本文自认的局限/未来工作**：(1) 仅考虑完全观测变量（因果充分性），不处理隐变量；(2) 只支持图形类知识，未来应可条件化于函数机制性质或隐变量结构；(3) 缺乏综合的真实世界因果基准，阻碍实用型「全合一」CFM 的开发与评估。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2602.14972.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attr